The =FA protects against only one real threat: thrown !paralysis.
Priestly paralysis and other issues are covered by MR.  So =FA is
really a luxury item; if you've got it it helps survival chances
slightly, but it's far from a showstopper.

Candles are required.  You could run around waiting for more to drop.
Personally I'd use a wish, since that's what they're there for and
wishless is an easy enough conduct that you'll get it some time
anyway.  There's not much point in forcing a really boring wait for
random drops on yourself.  But it's up to you.


